---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Team" description="Researchers and students of the HelioFísica and Space Weather USACH group.">

<section>
  <span class="section-title">Team</span>
  <h1>Our team</h1>
  <p class="lead">The HelioFísica and Space Weather group is co-led by Dr. Victor A. Pinto and Prof. Marina Stepanova, Department of Physics, Universidad de Santiago de Chile.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="section-title">Principal investigators</span>
  <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Dr. Victor A. Pinto Abarzúa</h3>
      <p><strong>Assistant Professor</strong> · Department of Physics, USACH</p>
      <p>Ph.D. in Atmospheric and Oceanic Sciences (Space Physics), UCLA 2019 (co-advisors: L. Lyons, J. Bortnik). Postdoctoral research at UNH (2020-2022). Researcher in radiation belts, ULF waves, solar wind—magnetosphere coupling, machine learning for space weather, and geomagnetically induced currents (GIC). Associate Editor of <em>Space Weather</em> (AGU/Wiley).</p>
      <div style="margin-top:0.75rem">
        <a href="https://victorapinto.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Personal site</a> ·
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=nEqGWqoAAAAJ" target="_blank">Google Scholar</a> ·
        <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1210-167X" target="_blank">ORCID</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Prof. Marina Stepanova</h3>
      <p><strong>Professor</strong> · Department of Physics, USACH · Head, B.S. Astrophysics Program</p>
      <p>Ph.D. in Astrophysics, Skobeltsyn Institute of Nuclear Physics, Lomonosov Moscow State University. At USACH since 1995. Researcher in space plasmas, Earth's magnetospheric dynamics, turbulence in space plasmas, geomagnetic storms and substorms, plasma configuration stability, and complex systems. Active collaborations with research groups in the US and Russia. Has supervised 8+ graduate students.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:0.75rem">
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=Rb-PfE4AAAAJ" target="_blank">Google Scholar</a> ·
        <a href="https://investigadores.anid.cl/es/public_search/researcher?id=8491" target="_blank">ANID PDI</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

