<section class="section">
  <span class="section-title">Open positions</span>
  <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--border-accent)">
    <p>We are looking for master's and undergraduate students for research projects:</p>
    <ul style="margin:1rem 0 0 1.5rem">
      <li>Relativistic electron dynamics in the outer radiation belt</li>
      <li>Geomagnetic storm prediction with Deep Learning</li>
      <li>Geomagnetically induced currents (GIC)</li>
      <li>Satellite data processing (Van Allen Probes, THEMIS, GOES)</li>
      <li>Turbulence and pressure balance in the magnetosphere</li>
      <li>Solar wind — magnetosphere coupling</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:1rem">If you are a physics, astrophysics, or related science student, email us at <a href="mailto:victor.pinto@usach.cl">victor.pinto@usach.cl</a></p>
  </div>
